Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 26
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 48
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 44
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/aaa-protracker && export PS1='protracker $ ' PYTHONPATH=src PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
